            "relationship": "thematic"
          },
          {
            "context": {
              "ar": "نداء أهل النار لمالك خازن جهنم أن يقضي عليهم ربهم وجوابه أنهم ماكثون",
              "en": "The people of Hellfire calling upon Malik, the keeper of Hell, asking him to let their Lord put an end to them, and his response that they shall remain."
